    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. Phase-modulation synthesis in the manner of the four- and six-operator FM keyboards of the eighties (sine operators, an envelope per operator, a handful of fixed algorithms, averaged operator feedback); not a model of any one instrument, and no patch data from one."
